    REFACTOR-0002: every role implements Employee
    
    Each single-person role answers for themself: its total salary is its
    own, and its headcount is 1. Manager already answers all three
    questions, so it only needs to say so.
    
    Manager still keeps one array per role and still loops over each one,
    so nothing asks a role these questions through Employee yet.

